# A sweep over an origin holding no claim releases nothing and says so. What it
# does with a claim it finds depends on origin's activity record and its open
# pull requests, which are not this repository's to answer for.
run sweep
exit 0
file tasks/M1-01.md
	---
	id: M1-01
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: no
	---
stdout
	no claims on origin
